cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use T1DUJxUoM in academic work, please cite the archived software release and the source-code repository using the metadata below."

title: "T1DUJxUoM: Cohort-Fair Multimodal Digital Twins for Type 1 Diabetes"
type: software

abstract: "T1DUJxUoM is a reproducible research software package for evaluating physics-guided, multi-horizon digital twin models for Type 1 Diabetes. The package includes code, configuration files, pretrained/demo artefacts, and in-silico counterfactual evaluation protocols designed to assess autoregressive glucose forecasting, insulin-carbohydrate responsiveness, and physiologically plausible model behaviour under clinically relevant perturbation scenarios."

